  "ruleText": "Env-A 1709.01 Form ARD-7, Information Required for Permits for Engines and Turbines. In addition to Form ARD-1, an applicant for a permit for a turbine or engine shall complete and submit Form ARD-7, “Information Required for Permits for Engines and Turbines” dated September 9, 2019.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; amd by #6506-B, eff 5-1-97; ss by #7886, eff 5-3-03; ss by #9707, INTERIM, eff 5-3-11, EXPIRES: 10-31-11; ss by #10001, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12965, eff 1-6-20",
